   "universe = today's listed names \u2265 \u20b91,000 Cr \u2192 survivorship bias, favours the whole universe not the ranking",
   "statements available only after a 75-day (annual) / 50-day (quarterly) lag",
   "Yahoo gives 4 fiscal years \u2192 fundamental factors are thin before mid-2025"
  ]
 }
}